{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01Jmh6rUNpXVkX37CCJM9mJ4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All gates pass and the diff is clean. The implementation is complete:\n\n- **Trigger gate** (`pipeline.ts`): the advance registration stays at its pinned first-before-poke site, throw-isolated; the callback now consults a flag set only when the walk records a `turn_end` (skipped duplicates never set it).\n- **Decision reshape** (`boundary.ts`): zone rows carry `turn_id`, group consecutively (NULL → singleton), and the walk evicts whole oldest groups only while the post-eviction sum stays ≥ target; the open turn's group and the newest remaining group are never candidates.\n- **Config** (`view.ts`/`profiles.ts`): two-field budgets, 64k/32k defaults, `max > target` validation, `floorTokens` rejected as unknown config.\n- **Tests**: new `view-boundary-turn-end.test.ts` (TC-5.1/5.2/5.3, G2 worked golden, exact-target, newest-turn protection, turnless singleton); `view-boundary.test.ts` amended per the ledger; G1 trajectory golden re-cut for turn grouping; ripple amendments in `view-fixture`, `inspect-view`, `view-pull`; red-manifest regenerated; immutability check green.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"ready-for-verification\",\n  \"planSummary\": \"Gated the existing post-commit boundary-advance registration in intake's pipeline on a recorded turn_end (same registration site, ordering, and throw isolation); reshaped the boundary decision to whole-turn groups (turn_id-consecutive grouping, NULL as singleton) with the peek-ahead stop (evict only while remaining ≥ target) and protection for both the open turn's group and the newest remaining group; retired floorTokens from VisibilityBudgets with 64k/32k defaults, max > target validation, and rejection of unknown budget fields; applied the Epic 03 amendment ledger to view-boundary.test.ts and the G1 trajectory golden (re-cut for turn grouping), superseded the floor/monster-turn legs into the new TC-5.2 newest-turn-protection legs, added view-boundary-turn-end.test.ts covering TC-5.1–TC-5.3 including golden G2 (30k/25k/20k/15k under defaults landing the zone at 35k), and regenerated the red manifest. Story gate (verify) and epic gate (verify-all) both pass: 40 files, 376 passed, 9 env-gated skips.\",\n  \"changedFiles\": [\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/domains/intake-stream/internal/pipeline.ts\", \"reason\": \"AC-5.1: advance registration gated on a recorded turn_end via a walk-set flag; registration site, advance-before-poke order, and throw isolation untouched\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/boundary.ts\", \"reason\": \"AC-5.1–5.3: zone read gains turn_id, groupZone builds whole-turn eviction units, advanceDecision becomes the peek-ahead whole-group walk excluding the open turn's group and the newest candidate group\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/shared/view.ts\", \"reason\": \"AC-5.4: VisibilityBudgets reduced to { maxTokens, targetTokens }; default comment updated to 64000/32000\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/profiles.ts\", \"reason\": \"AC-5.4: DEFAULT_VISIBILITY 64000/32000, floor validation removed, unknown budget fields (floorTokens) rejected at construction with a TypeError naming the field\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/view-boundary-turn-end.test.ts\", \"reason\": \"New story-owned suite: TC-5.1 (turn-end trigger, byte-stable mid-turn pulls, exactly-one-advance counting, whole-turn all-or-nothing, turnless singleton), TC-5.2 (golden G2 under 64k/32k defaults, exact-target ≥ leg, oversized-newest protection, max ≤ target TypeError, defaults), TC-5.3 (replay determinism + forward-only)\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/view-boundary.test.ts\", \"reason\": \"Amendment ledger applied: per-intake legs re-cut for turn grouping, old TC-4.3 floor legs superseded (note left pointing at TC-5.2), construction tests moved to two-field budgets plus the floorTokens-rejected leg, TC-4.6 heal re-cut to multi-turn batches, seam-direction-two re-cut to the 64k/32k defaults; status zoneTokens assertions kept (shared-query invariant)\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/goldens/boundary-g1-trajectory.json\", \"reason\": \"G1 re-cut for turn grouping and turn-end trigger: 6 batches covering under-max closes, whole-turn eviction with peek-ahead, no-move close, mid-turn over-max hold, and the healing close that evicts three groups\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/view-select-golden.test.ts\", \"reason\": \"BoundaryGolden budgets type reduced to two fields; G1 comments updated to the turn-end contract (replay-equality leg unchanged)\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/goldens/README.md\", \"reason\": \"boundary-g1-trajectory row updated to describe the re-cut rule set\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/fixtures/view-boundary.ts\", \"reason\": \"New boundary fixture: boundaryTokens/boundaryToolRun/turnedToolResultEvents/seedTurnedToolResults — scripted closed/open/turnless turns seeded through real intake commits\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/fixtures/index.ts\", \"reason\": \"Re-export the new boundary fixture helpers\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/view-fixture.test.ts\", \"reason\": \"Construction legs: target<floor leg replaced by floorTokens-unknown rejection; defaults assertion updated to 64000/32000\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/inspect-view.test.ts\", \"reason\": \"Boundary-advanced fixture leg: floorTokens dropped from small budgets (same expected positions under turn grouping); comment updated\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/view-pull.test.ts\", \"reason\": \"Status leg's default maxTokens expectation 32000 → 64000 (downstream of AC-5.4 defaults)\" },\n    { \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/red-manifest.json\", \"reason\": \"Regenerated hashes for the amended/new Red-phase files after applying the amendment ledger